The activation system (raceguard::license::* APIs) is the gate between two
modes:

  - DEMO     — works on any unmodified ESP32. UI animations + mock data only.
               OBD / SD / activation-restricted features are disabled.
  - ACTIVATED — requires a valid activation code (16-char HMAC) bound to the
                chip ID. Either pre-burned to NVS at factory, or entered
                through the in-device WiFi AP setup flow.

